  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-ui-fortifier",
      "text": "[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-ui-fortifier)\n\n[中文](./README.zh.md)\n\nA DSH Web UI enhancer plugin\n\nSee [design/en/current.md](design/en/current.md) for details."
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-ui-fortifier\n```\n\n**Installing via GitHub is not supported.**"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "Adds a configuration area to this plugin's own card on the sidebar's Plugins page, toggling every feature module of this plugin."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "| Feature | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| session-id-copy | Copy-session-ID button in the Session header's utility group. |\n| compact-button | Compact-context button at the right end of the composer tool row's left group; runs `/compact`. |\n| provider-label | Shows the currently selected provider to the left of the model selector. |\n| model-picker | Cascading model picker (provider → model) next to the model selector in the input row. |\n| open-dsh-folder | Adds an \"Open dshHome folder\" button next to \"Open configuration file\" at the top-right of the Settings page. |\n| settings-frame | Makes the Settings panel draggable and resizable. |"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh version used for development",
      "text": "- dsh version used for development: `0.1.7-rc.2`. `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` dependencies use `workspace:^`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Secondary Development",
      "text": "Clone this repository into a dsh workspace package directory, then install and build:\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/pgnqukezrdxmhjso/dsh-ui-fortifier packages/my/dsh-ui-fortifier\npnpm install\npnpm --filter dsh-ui-fortifier build\n```\n\n---\n\nNo runtime invariant companion is published because this package is a pure slot surface: it registers slots, a settings namespace, and one Remote endpoint, and owns no event stream or mutable state to assert."
    }
  ],
